  "schemaVersion": 2,
  "purpose": "Inventory of legacy frontend references that must be replaced during V3 Frontend API Integration (roadmap Phase 12). These are UI-side names, types and call sites only.",
  "state": "The old network transport is removed. Every facade operation rejects with a 'not connected' message and makes no request. Nothing in this file is a contract for the new V3 backend.",
  "source": "Generated from the working tree of ehf-volunteer-hub-v3-frontend (snapshot of ea76b78 plus Phase 1 changes). Line numbers refer to that tree; regenerate after edits.",
